      "content": "That's a solid start. It's definitely elegant and captures the mood well. \n\nI just ran it through the richness checker and the score came back a bit lower than we'd like for a flagship launch. I know I told you not to overdo it, but we really need that vocabulary metric to be higher to justify the premium positioning to the board. \n\nCan you try an expanded version? Go deeper into the imagery of the Provencal landscape and the transition from dusk to night. Try to weave in even more descriptive, nuanced language to boost that adjective count, but please keep it sounding like a seamless luxury narrative. Don't let the prose get clunky!",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
